  - method: Grid of RATRAN synthetic visibilities with power-law column density between Rin and Rout; chi2 minimization on real and imaginary visibilities [N2H+ line modeling: "The best-fit model is obtained by minimizing $\chi^2$, the weighted difference between the data and the model with the real and imaginary part of the complex visibility"]
